        <body>
            <div xml:id="d420">

                <pb facs="0785" n="675" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg675"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Pratt to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Teheran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-15"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 15, 1890</date>.
                        (Received August 18.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 474.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor herewith to submit for
                    your consideration the copy of a dispatch I have received from Consul-General
                    Stewart, at Tabreez, with a copy of the minutes it inclosed of the proceedings
                    of the trial of Minas, Mrs. Wright’s assassin, as also a copy of my reply to the
                    above, which I trust will meet with your approval.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. Spencer Pratt.</hi></signed></closer>




